<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimated Friday 85,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimated Friday 85,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimated interior Iowa and southern  Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 85,000 head, compared with 92,000  a week ago and 89,000 a year ago, USDA said.</p>
<p>Saturday receipts were estimated at 5,000 head versus 13,000 head  a week ago and 10,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows  and gilts were firm to $0.50 per cwt higher than mid-session Thursday.  Trade and demand light to moderate.</p>
<p>Offerings moderate.</p>
